Description: Use Pyright instead of Pylance for CanMV stubs
 Pylance is licensed for Microsoft products only and is not on Open VSX, so the
 IDE cannot install it. CanMV only writes python.analysis.* settings, which the
 open-source Pyright extension also registers and honors. Depend on and check
 for ms-pyright.pyright, and say Pyright in messages and documentation.
 Internal names and the k230_canmv_pylance overlay path are kept so existing
 user settings stay valid.
Author: pzhlkj6612
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-05
